      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 4.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Good morning. Come in have a a seat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.97,
      "end_seconds": 6.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.01,
      "end_seconds": 12.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "doctor, I'm just here to help with the the details"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.5,
      "end_seconds": 17.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 19.15,
      "end_seconds": 24.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "We came because of itching that wakes me at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.18,
      "end_seconds": 28.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.1,
      "end_seconds": 32.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I've, I've had it since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.68,
      "end_seconds": 41.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is what the pattern is what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.64,
      "end_seconds": 48.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "about a seven out of ten it's a couple of times a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.39,
      "end_seconds": 52.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Any redness as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.57,
      "end_seconds": 61.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "yeah that too. And there's an itchy rash as well about three months now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.74,
      "end_seconds": 66.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Okay give me more detail on it whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.32,
      "end_seconds": 86.05,
      "duration_seconds": 18.73,
      "text": "Oh, it's a couple of times a week. I'd call it severe. And, And there's cracked skin on my hands as well, about two weeks now. Well, as for cracked skin on my hands, I'd call it mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.21,
      "end_seconds": 94.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "text": "have you had itching that wakes you at night before or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.76,
      "end_seconds": 105.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "yes, uh, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.52,
      "end_seconds": 112.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "and what about fever or new soap or detergent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.5,
      "end_seconds": 118.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "okay so no no fever or new soap or detergent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.64,
      "end_seconds": 124.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Did you get oozing or similar rash in family members?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.09,
      "end_seconds": 130.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "No no oozing or similar rash in family members."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.41,
      "end_seconds": 134.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.9,
      "end_seconds": 137.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "no nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.0,
      "end_seconds": 140.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.97,
      "end_seconds": 146.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "I had a stent put in my heart two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.49,
      "end_seconds": 153.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "anyone in the the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.46,
      "end_seconds": 161.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "hmm, my father had kidney stones. My father had a heart attack"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.16,
      "end_seconds": 174.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.83,
      "end_seconds": 190.64,
      "duration_seconds": 15.81,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day. I go to the gym a couple of times a week. Mostly home-cooked food, rice and vegetables. Yes, I'm a nurse on a busy ward."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.0,
      "end_seconds": 210.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "what medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.97,
      "end_seconds": 214.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "It's Asthalin inhaler, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 215.41,
      "end_seconds": 223.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "hmm, you know, it's meant to be when needed, though I don't see she take it every time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.62,
      "end_seconds": 233.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "I take clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day i'm on moisturiser, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.45,
      "end_seconds": 238.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "tell me about your health in general, any ongoing conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.05,
      "end_seconds": 245.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "I've had eczema for two years now. Yes asthma. I've got heart disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.96,
      "end_seconds": 257.25,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "mm. Okay I can see eczema in your file as well. Are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.83,
      "end_seconds": 265.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "uh, not currently, but as a youngster aspirin gave me wheezing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.43,
      "end_seconds": 270.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.51,
      "end_seconds": 284.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "okay give me a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.72,
      "end_seconds": 316.24,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 124 over 77, heart rate 79, temperature 36.9. And SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.85,
      "end_seconds": 321.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "right, let me check a few things physically"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.39,
      "end_seconds": 324.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "hold that position for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.98,
      "end_seconds": 345.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "no signs of infection, no crusting"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.88,
      "end_seconds": 349.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Just relax I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.55,
      "end_seconds": 372.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "there are dry red patches in the the creases of both elbows with scratch marks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.95,
      "end_seconds": 389.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "okay, ready"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.48,
      "end_seconds": 424.83,
      "duration_seconds": 32.35,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up. You'll be taking cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night, for one week. You take it by mouth. That's for itching. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Moisturise right after a bath, thick creams are better than lotions, and use a mild soap. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Please come and see me in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 426.18,
      "end_seconds": 429.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Good. Let us know how you get on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 430.15,
      "end_seconds": 432.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 433.24,
      "end_seconds": 434.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Safe journey home."
    }
  ]
}